{"seq":2,"slug":"kubernetes-essentials","title":"Kubernetes 核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/kubernetes-essentials","wordCount":1221,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"kubernetes-核心\">Kubernetes 核心</h1><h2 id=\"kubernetes-是什么\">Kubernetes 是什么</h2><p>Kubernetes（简称 K8s）是一个开源的容器编排平台，用于自动化容器化应用的部署、扩缩容和管理。它最初由 Google 基于内部 Borg 系统的经验设计，现已成为云原生基础设施的事实标准。</p>\n<p>Kubernetes 解决的核心问题：当你有成百上千个容器需要运行时，如何决定它们运行在哪台机器上？如何确保它们始终保持运行？如何让它们相互通信？如何在不中断服务的情况下更新它们？</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"架构概览\">架构概览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 控制平面 Control Plane&#10;        A[kube-apiserver] --&gt; B[etcd]&#10;        C[kube-scheduler] --&gt; A&#10;        D[kube-controller-manager] --&gt; A&#10;        E[cloud-controller-manager] --&gt; A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 工作节点 Node 1&#10;        F[kubelet] --&gt; A&#10;        G[kube-proxy]&#10;        H[Pod A]&#10;        I[Pod B]&#10;        F --&gt; H&#10;        F --&gt; I&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 工作节点 Node 2&#10;        J[kubelet] --&gt; A&#10;        K[kube-proxy]&#10;        L[Pod C]&#10;        M[Pod D]&#10;        J --&gt; L&#10;        J --&gt; M&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 控制平面 Control Plane\n        A[kube-apiserver] --&gt; B[etcd]\n        C[kube-scheduler] --&gt; A\n        D[kube-controller-manager] --&gt; A\n        E[cloud-controller-manager] --&gt; A\n    end\n    subgraph 工作节点 Node 1\n        F[kubelet] --&gt; A\n        G[kube-proxy]\n        H[Pod A]\n        I[Pod B]\n        F --&gt; H\n        F --&gt; I\n    end\n    subgraph 工作节点 Node 2\n        J[kubelet] --&gt; A\n        K[kube-proxy]\n        L[Pod C]\n        M[Pod D]\n        J --&gt; L\n        J --&gt; M\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"控制平面组件\">控制平面组件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>kube-apiserver</td>\n<td>K8s 的 API 入口，所有操作都通过它</td>\n<td>前台接待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>etcd</td>\n<td>分布式键值存储，保存集群所有状态</td>\n<td>数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kube-scheduler</td>\n<td>决定 Pod 运行在哪个节点</td>\n<td>调度员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kube-controller-manager</td>\n<td>运行各种控制器，维护期望状态</td>\n<td>巡检员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工作节点组件\">工作节点组件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>kubelet</td>\n<td>管理节点上的 Pod 生命周期</td>\n<td>确保容器按规格运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kube-proxy</td>\n<td>维护节点的网络规则</td>\n<td>实现 Service 的负载均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器运行时</td>\n<td>运行容器</td>\n<td>containerd 或 CRI-O</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kubernetes 是一个容器编排平台，用于自动化容器化应用的部署、扩缩容与管理。理解它需要先把握一组贯穿全文的基本概念。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>在本主题中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>控制平面</td>\n<td>apiserver、etcd、scheduler 等管理组件</td>\n<td>维护集群的期望状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作节点 Node</td>\n<td>运行 Pod 的机器，含 kubelet、kube-proxy</td>\n<td>承载实际工作负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pod</td>\n<td>最小调度单元，一个或多个容器的集合</td>\n<td>K8s 的基本部署单位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>声明式管理 Pod 副本与滚动更新</td>\n<td>无状态应用的编排对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td>为一组 Pod 提供稳定的访问入口与负载均衡</td>\n<td>解决 Pod 地址不固定的问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Namespace</td>\n<td>集群内资源的逻辑隔离单元</td>\n<td>多团队/多环境隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RBAC</td>\n<td>基于角色的访问控制</td>\n<td>控制谁可以对哪些资源做什么</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Kubernetes 的核心思想是<strong>声明式管理</strong>与<strong>控制循环</strong>：你描述期望状态，控制器不断对比实际状态并纠正差异。理解这一点，就能理解 Deployment、Service 等对象为何都以&quot;期望状态&quot;的方式声明。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心资源\">核心资源</h2><h3 id=\"pod\">Pod</h3><p>Pod 是 K8s 中最小的调度和部署单元。一个 Pod 可以包含一个或多个紧密关联的容器，它们共享网络和存储。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Pod&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: web&#10;    version: v1&#10;spec:&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      image: myapp:1.0.0&#10;      ports:&#10;        - containerPort: 3000&#10;      resources:&#10;        requests:&#10;          cpu: &#39;100m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;128Mi&#39;&#10;        limits:&#10;          cpu: &#39;500m&#39;&#10;          memory: &#39;512Mi&#39;&#10;      livenessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /healthz&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        initialDelaySeconds: 10&#10;        periodSeconds: 15&#10;      readinessProbe:&#10;        httpGet:&#10;          path: /ready&#10;          port: 3000&#10;        initialDelaySeconds: 5&#10;        periodSeconds: 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'128Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'500m'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'512Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      livenessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/healthz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      readinessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"探针类型\">探针类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>探针</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>livenessProbe</td>\n<td>检查容器是否存活</td>\n<td>重启容器</td>\n<td>检测死锁或无法恢复的状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>readinessProbe</td>\n<td>检查容器是否准备好接收流量</td>\n<td>从 Service 端点移除</td>\n<td>启动预热、依赖就绪检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>startupProbe</td>\n<td>检查容器是否完成启动</td>\n<td>重启容器</td>\n<td>启动缓慢的应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"deployment\">Deployment</h3><p>Deployment 管理 Pod 的声明式更新，提供滚动更新和回滚能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: web-app&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: web&#10;  strategy:&#10;    type: RollingUpdate&#10;    rollingUpdate:&#10;      maxSurge: 1&#10;      maxUnavailable: 0&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: web&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: app&#10;          image: myapp:1.0.0&#10;          ports:&#10;            - containerPort: 3000&#10;          resources:&#10;            requests:&#10;              cpu: &#39;100m&#39;&#10;              memory: &#39;128Mi&#39;&#10;            limits:&#10;              cpu: &#39;500m&#39;&#10;              memory: &#39;512Mi&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"colo