> -f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tail=100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -it</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod-nam</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /bin/sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Deployment 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --replicas=5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/web-app</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=myapp:2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Service 管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> services</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> port-forward</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> service/web-service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 8080:80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 调试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort-by=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.lastTimestamp'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodes</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"资源管理\">资源管理</h2><h3 id=\"requests-和-limits\">Requests 和 Limits</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>调度影响</th>\n<th>运行影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>requests</td>\n<td>Pod 运行所需的最小资源</td>\n<td>调度器根据 requests 分配节点</td>\n<td>保证能获取到的资源量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>limits</td>\n<td>Pod 可使用的最大资源</td>\n<td>不影响调度</td>\n<td>超过 CPU 限制会被节流，超过内存限制会被 OOMKilled</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"qos-类别\">QoS 类别</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Pod QoS 类别] --&gt; B[Guaranteed&lt;br/&gt;requests = limits]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Burstable&lt;br/&gt;requests &lt; limits]&#10;    A --&gt; D[BestEffort&lt;br/&gt;无 requests/limits]&#10;    B --&gt; E[最高优先级&lt;br/&gt;最后被驱逐]&#10;    C --&gt; F[中等优先级]&#10;    D --&gt; G[最低优先级&lt;br/&gt;最先被驱逐]\">graph TD\n    A[Pod QoS 类别] --&gt; B[Guaranteed&lt;br/&gt;requests = limits]\n    A --&gt; C[Burstable&lt;br/&gt;requests &lt; limits]\n    A --&gt; D[BestEffort&lt;br/&gt;无 requests/limits]\n    B --&gt; E[最高优先级&lt;br/&gt;最后被驱逐]\n    C --&gt; F[中等优先级]\n    D --&gt; G[最低优先级&lt;br/&gt;最先被驱逐]</pre><p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：始终为生产 Pod 设置 requests 和 limits。关键服务使用 Guaranteed QoS（requests = limits），非关键服务可以使用 Burstable。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"namespace-和-rbac\">Namespace 和 RBAC</h2><h3 id=\"namespace\">Namespace</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建命名空间&#10;kubectl create namespace staging&#10;kubectl create namespace production&#10;&#10;# 在命名空间中创建资源&#10;kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml -n production&#10;&#10;# 设置默认命名空间&#10;kubectl config set-context --current --namespace=production\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建命名空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> staging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在命名空间中创建资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置默认命名空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set-context</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --current</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace=production</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"resourcequota\">ResourceQuota</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ResourceQuota&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: team-quota&#10;  namespace: team-a&#10;spec:&#10;  hard:&#10;    requests.cpu: &#39;10&#39;&#10;    requests.memory: 20Gi&#10;    limits.cpu: &#39;20&#39;&#10;    limits.memory: 40Gi&#10;    pods: &#39;50&#39;&#10;    services: &#39;10&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ResourceQuota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team-quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team-a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    requests.cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    requests.memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">20Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limits.cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'20'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limits.memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">40Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pods</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Kubernetes 通过声明式 API 管理容器化应用的完整生命周期。理解 Pod、Deployment、Service 和 ConfigMap 这四个核心资源是使用 K8s 的基础。掌握资源管理（requests/limits）、更新策略（RollingUpdate）和探针配置（liveness/readiness）是保障生产环境稳定性的关键。Kubernetes 的学习曲线较陡，建议从单个应用的部署开始，逐步扩展到多服务编排和集群管理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kubernetes 核心","id":"kubernetes-核心"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 是什么","id":"kubernetes-是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"架构概览","id":"架构概览"},{"level":3,"text":"控制平面组件","id":"控制平面组件"},{"level":3,"text":"工作节点组件","id":"工作节点组件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心资源","id":"核心资源"},{"level":3,"text":"Pod","id":"pod"},{"level":3,"text":"探针类型","id":"探针类型"},{"level":3,"text":"Deployment","id":"deployment"},{"level":3,"text":"更新策略对比","id":"更新策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Service","id":"service"},{"level":3,"text":"Service 类型","id":"service-类型"},{"level":3,"text":"ConfigMap 和 Secret","id":"configmap-和-secret"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 kubectl 命令","id":"常用-kubectl-命令"},{"level":2,"text":"资源管理","id":"资源管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Requests 和 Limits","id":"requests-和-limits"},{"level":3,"text":"QoS 类别","id":"qos-类别"},{"level":2,"text":"Namespace 和 RBAC","id":"namespace-和-rbac"},{"level":3,"text":"Namespace","id":"namespace"},{"level":3,"text":"ResourceQuota","id":"resourcequota"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"容器基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/container-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"服务网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/service-mesh"}}